  "abstract": "Covers the OpenID Shared Signals Framework 1.0, CAEP 1.0 and RISC 1.0 Finals as the current line, with the Implementer's Draft lines (spec_version 1_0-ID3, 1_0-ID2 and the 1_0-ID1 SSE framework) as legacy and upgrade steps from each, the CAEP Interoperability Profile (Implementer's Draft 1, with the working-group draft tracked), the IETF SET, push, poll and subject identifier RFCs, and OpenID Connect Back-Channel Logout as a related revocation input. SKILL.md holds the invariants and workflow; references/ holds the version hub and splits SETs and subjects, event types, transmitter, receiver, the interoperability profile with conformance testing, and back-channel logout.",
